			<DisplayName>Heavy Resource Claim Pylon</DisplayName>
			<Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\Cubes\KJN_KWP_RES_ResourceClaimPylon_Heavy.dds</Icon>
			<Description>A powerful mining pylon by AED (Advanced Exploration Dynamics) capable of extracting ore deposits without consuming them. Placing it near other pylons will cause a decrease in yield efficiency.

Base Ore Output: 90 units per cycle
Mining Range: 1000m (350m depth)
Ally Interferrence Range: 10km
Enemy Suppression Range: 15km
Interference Penalty: 10%
Suppression Penalty: 30%</Description>
